{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been selected for an ultra-advanced experiment to evaluate a simulation. Your goal: finish as fast as possible while testing your perseverance, patience, and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do Up is a minimalist 3D platform game in which you use your parkour skills and that challenges you throughout the game. Overcome fast obstacles and challenge your own records.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple, Yet Ruthless</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t be fooled by the clean design. The minimalist look hides a relentless challenge\u2014every move is an opportunity to fail. But victory\u2026 it\u2019s within your reach. How many attempts will it take before you break?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617750/extras/c416c5e0af3b0a3e6da641c449d77a64.poster.avif?t=1749561858\" width=616 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617750/extras/c416c5e0af3b0a3e6da641c449d77a64.webm?t=1749561858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617750/extras/c416c5e0af3b0a3e6da641c449d77a64.mp4?t=1749561858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready for the Ultimate Test?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you think you're good at parkour, <i>Do Up</i> will push you even further. Dodge obstacles, break limits, and conquer yourself. The question isn\u2019t <i>if</i> you\u2019ll fail, but <i>when</i>\u2014and what you\u2019ll do next.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617750?t=1749561858","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617750?t=1749561858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.stea